    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d131">

                <pb facs="0122" n="112" xml:id="pg112"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">715.1715/1024: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Special Representative of the President</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Corrigan</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">San
                                José</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-12-11T18:00:00-06:00">December 11, 1937—6
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 7:50 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>38. Referring to my telegram No. 37, December 10, 1 p.m.,<anchor n="62"
                        xml:id="d131-f1"/> the Pact of Mutual Agreements for Preservation of Peace
                    between Honduras and Nicaragua was signed today at 5:30 p.m.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Corrigan</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
